# Breeches, the Blastmaker: "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, you may sacrifice an artifact. If you do, flip a
# coin. When you win the flip, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy." Turn 3: Black Lotus is Bot1's first
# spell (no trigger), the first Lightning Bolt at Bot2 is the second: Bot1 sacrifices Mox Jet (one artifact at most), wins the
# flip (die face 1), and the reflexive ability copies the Bolt, the copy retargeted at Bot2's Memnite. The second Bolt is the
# third spell and triggers nothing. Breeches has menace.

